      "writtenOn": "2019-09-10T07:29:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a new downstream type then. Does the entitlement app know about this ? If not, how do you intend to handle entitlement ?\n(note that for the same reason it will probably need to be @SystemApi)\n\nMark : do you know of other uses of these constants than tethering that we may have to care about too ?",
