      "message": "It is a protected broadcast indeed. Thanks!\n\nhttps://developer.android.com/reference/android/net/wifi/p2p/WifiP2pManager#WIFI_P2P_CONNECTION_CHANGED_ACTION\n\n\u003cprotected-broadcast android:name\u003d\"android.net.wifi.p2p.CONNECTION_STATE_CHANGE\" /\u003e",
